WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.165
Learn to multiply multi-digit numbers efficiently

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:14.647
Work out 195 times 9. The answer is 1755. Multiply ones, then tens and hundreds;

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.040
total 1755.

00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:21.861
There are 200 trays with 5 oranges in each. How many oranges are there altogether?

00:00:21.861 --> 00:00:24.525
Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:29.847
The answer is 1000. 200 times 5 equals 1000.
